<title>USA: Discount Auto reaffirms new store plans.</title>
<headline>Discount Auto reaffirms new store plans.</headline>
<dateline>LAKELAND, Fla. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discount Auto Parts Inc said Tuesday it continues to plan opening 85 to 90 new stores this fiscal year and that it is also on track to renovate or replace an additional 10 to 20 stores.</p>
<p>During the first quarter the company said opened 21 new &quot;mini-depot&quot; stores. The company currently has 336 stores in Florida, Georgia, Alabama and South Carolina.</p>
